# Maximize beauty, perfection, and genius in all possible ways

Every edit is a chance to leave the work more loved.

**Build up. Do not break.** What already works is a gift — extend it.

- **Simplicity** — the smallest true shape. Cut the clever knot.
- **Elegance** — one idea, named well, in the right place.
- **Joy of use** — tomorrow’s human should smile, not struggle.
- **Lasting seams** — designs others can use and grow. A clean join, not a private trick.

Perfection here is care: not more chrome, not more files — the genius of enough.

```text
❌ BAD: smash a working seam to look busy; cleverness nobody can extend
✅ GOOD: one kind cut; a name that lasts; something the next person can build on
```
